       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     SPRTINFO.
       AUTHOR.         ANNETTE M. KRAUSS.
       INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   JUNE 9, 1987.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *REMARKS.
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *D   SPRTINFO     PRINTER INFORMATION SUBPROGRAM             *
      *D                                                           *
      **************************************************************
      *C
      *C  93/11/12   BK DISMUKES   NO REQUEST
      *C     1. ADDED SECOND PAGE TO PRINTER OPTIONS SCREEN FOR
      *C        STOREROOM PRINT OPTIONS.
      *C
      *C  03/23/94   JS BUNGO  REQUEST #6488
      *C     ADDED PRINTER OPTION FOR SHIPPING RELEASE PRINTER.
      *C
      *C   5/25/94   MARVIN MITCHELL REQUEST #94-017
      *C     ADDED TWO MORE PRINTER OPTIONS FOR PRINTING QUOTES.
      *C        NOTE: THIS ENHANCEMENT WAS NOT ADDED TO HP-3000
      *C              SOURCE PROGRAMS. (L.KOLB)
      *C   8/20/96   JEFF BUNGO
      *C     ADDED QUESTION FOR ALL REPORT PRINTING AS TO USE
      *C     REGULAR PRINT ONLY (NO ASCII CONTROL CHARACTERS).
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                   ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZPLTSTUP-SI
                   ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                   ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                   FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                   CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
            SELECT MPLTINFO-O
                   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                   ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                   RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                       PIC X(2000).
       FD  MPLTINFO-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500 OF MCFLCS0501.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1                 PIC X VALUE SPACE.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2                 PIC X VALUE SPACE.

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **              D A T A    B A S E    A R E A              **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       COPY MPLTINFO IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLTRQRL IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLTST   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.
       01  MPLTINFO-ARG                    PIC X(4).
       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT                    PIC X(64)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD                     PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD
                                           PIC Z(11)9.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **                 TERMINAL I/O DATA AREA                  **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       01  PRNT-SCREEN.
           05  PRINTER-INFO.
               10  PRINTER1              PIC X(2).
               10  PRINTER1-MPE-SPOOLED  PIC X(1).
               10  PRINTER2              PIC X(2).
               10  PRINTER1-HP-SW        PIC X(1).
               10  PRINTER2A             PIC X(2).
               10  PRINTER3              PIC X(2).
               10  PRINTER3A             PIC X(2).
               10  PRINTER3B             PIC X(2).
               10  PRINTER4              PIC X(2).
               10  PRINTER5              PIC X(2).
               10  PRINTER6              PIC X(2).
               10  PRINTER7              PIC X(2).
               10  PRINTER8              PIC X(2).
               10  PRINTER9              PIC X(2).
               10  PRINTER9-DOLLARS      PIC X(6).
           05  REQ-RLSE.
               10  REQ-RLSE-INDIC        PIC X(1).
               10  REQ-RLSE-PRINTER      PIC X(1).
           05  CAPITAL-ITEMS.
               10  CAPITAL-ITEM-INDIC    PIC X(1).
               10  CAPITAL-ITEM-PRT      PIC X(2).
           05  NOASCII-REPORTS           PIC X(1).
           05  PRNT-MSGLINE              PIC X(79).
           05  CMDLINE                   PIC X(79).
           05  ERR-MSGLINE               PIC X(79).

       01  PRNT-SCREEN2.
           05  DE-PRT-SNGL               PIC X(1).
           05  DE-SNGL-ADV               PIC 9(1).
           05  DE-PRT-MULT               PIC X(1).
           05  DE-WS-SPLIT               PIC 9(1).
           05  DE-ADV-LE-WS              PIC 9(1).
           05  DE-ADV-GT-WS              PIC 9(1).
           05  PRNT-MSGLINE2             PIC X(79).
           05  CMDLINE2                  PIC X(79).
           05  ERR-MSGLINE2              PIC X(79).

       COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDATA IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **               LINKAGE   SECTION                         **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  BASE                          PIC X(10).

       COPY VCOMLINK IN COPYLIB.

       COPY LANGSUB IN COPYLIB.


      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **          P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N           **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE,
                                VIEW-COMAREA,
                                LANGUAGE-PARMS.


       MAIN-PGM SECTION 01.

       BEGIN-HERE.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.

       1-HSK.
           MOVE "SPRTINFO" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O.
           GOBACK.

      ******************************************************
      **                 BLOWUP ROUTINE                   **
      ******************************************************

       2-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
               BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

      **************************************************
      *                                                *
      *                  6 - M A I N                   *
      *                                                *
      **************************************************

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE SPACES TO PRNT-SCREEN, PRNT-SCREEN2.

       6-READ-DATABASE.
           PERFORM 63-READ-MPLTINFO.

       6-PERFORM-PAGES.
           MOVE "PRNTINFO" TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           PERFORM 61-PAGE-1  THRU 61-PAGE-1-X.

           MOVE "PRNTINFO2" TO VIEW-NFNAME.
           PERFORM 62-PAGE-2  THRU 62-PAGE-2-X.

       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

       61-PAGE-1.
       61-PUT-BUFFER.

      ***  INPUT DATA ABOVE AND PRESS 'ENTER'  ***
           MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM.
           MOVE  20 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO PRNT-MSGLINE.

       61-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE PRNT-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO PRNT-SCREEN.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 61-PAGE-1-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERR-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
               GO TO 61-SHOW-FORM.

       61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO.
           IF CAPITAL-ITEM-INDIC = "N"
               MOVE ZEROS TO CAPITAL-ITEM-PRT.

           MOVE "POPT" TO MPLTINFO-ARG, BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE PRINTER1   TO MPLTINFO-PO-PRT-NO
               MOVE PRINTER1-MPE-SPOOLED TO MPLTINFO-PO-PRT-MPE-SPOOLED
               MOVE PRINTER2   TO MPLTINFO-REQ-PRT-NO
               MOVE PRINTER1-HP-SW       TO MPLTINFO-PO-HP-PRINTER-SW
               MOVE PRINTER2A  TO MPLTINFO-REQ-PRT-NO-2
               MOVE PRINTER3   TO MPLTINFO-01-QUOTE-PRT-NO
               PERFORM 610-SET-OTHER-QUOTE-P
               MOVE PRINTER3A  TO MPLTINFO-02-QUOTE-PRT-NO
               MOVE PRINTER3B  TO MPLTINFO-LP-QUOTE-PRT-NO
               MOVE PRINTER4   TO MPLTINFO-INTERN-PRT-1
               MOVE PRINTER5   TO MPLTINFO-INTERN-PRT-2
               MOVE PRINTER7   TO MPLTINFO-RAWMAT-PRT-NO
               MOVE PRINTER8   TO MPLTINFO-SHIP-REL-PRT-NO
               MOVE PRINTER9   TO MPLTINFO-PO-SPECIAL
               MOVE PRINTER9-DOLLARS TO MPLTINFO-PO-SP-AMOUNT
               MOVE CAPITAL-ITEM-PRT     TO MPLTINFO-CAP-ITEM-PRT
               MOVE NOASCII-REPORTS TO MPLTINFO-NOASCII-REPORTS
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "1REWRITE  ERROR IN 61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES     TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "POPT"     TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE PRINTER1   TO MPLTINFO-PO-PRT-NO
               MOVE PRINTER1-MPE-SPOOLED TO MPLTINFO-PO-PRT-MPE-SPOOLED
               MOVE PRINTER2   TO MPLTINFO-REQ-PRT-NO
               MOVE PRINTER1-HP-SW       TO MPLTINFO-PO-HP-PRINTER-SW
               MOVE PRINTER2A TO MPLTINFO-REQ-PRT-NO-2
               MOVE PRINTER3 TO MPLTINFO-01-QUOTE-PRT-NO
               PERFORM 610-SET-OTHER-QUOTE-P
               MOVE PRINTER3A  TO MPLTINFO-02-QUOTE-PRT-NO
               MOVE PRINTER3B  TO MPLTINFO-LP-QUOTE-PRT-NO
               MOVE PRINTER4   TO MPLTINFO-INTERN-PRT-1
               MOVE PRINTER5   TO MPLTINFO-INTERN-PRT-2
               MOVE PRINTER7   TO MPLTINFO-RAWMAT-PRT-NO
               MOVE PRINTER8   TO MPLTINFO-SHIP-REL-PRT-NO
               MOVE PRINTER9   TO MPLTINFO-PO-SPECIAL
               MOVE PRINTER9-DOLLARS TO MPLTINFO-PO-SP-AMOUNT
               MOVE CAPITAL-ITEM-PRT     TO MPLTINFO-CAP-ITEM-PRT
               MOVE NOASCII-REPORTS TO MPLTINFO-NOASCII-REPORTS
               WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-WRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "1WRT MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE "1READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      *------ NOW UPDATE STOREROOM PRINTER KEY 'ST00': TELLS WHICH
      *------ STOREROOM PRINTER FOR SINGLE-STOREROOM REMOTE WORKSHEET
           MOVE "ST00"                   TO   MPLTINFO-ARG,
                                              BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE PRINTER6             TO   MPLTINFO-STR-PRT
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "REWRITE  ERROR IN 61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO ST00"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE "ST00"               TO   MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE PRINTER6             TO   MPLTINFO-STR-PRT
               WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-WRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "WRT MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO ST00"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE "READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO ST00"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE "RQRL" TO MPLTINFO-ARG, BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           MOVE SPACES TO MPLTINFO-RQRL.
           IF REQ-RLSE-INDIC = "N"
               MOVE "NOPRT" TO REQ-RLSE-PRINT-CONTROL
           ELSE
               IF REQ-RLSE-PRINTER = "L"
                   MOVE "LOCAL" TO REQ-RLSE-PRINT-CONTROL
               ELSE
                   MOVE "PURCH" TO REQ-RLSE-PRINT-CONTROL.

           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                  INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "2DBUPDATE ERROR IN 61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "RQRL" TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-WRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "2WRT MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE "2READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 61-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       61-PAGE-1-X.
           EXIT.

       610-SET-OTHER-QUOTE-P.
            IF PRINTER3A = "  " MOVE PRINTER3 TO PRINTER3A.
            IF PRINTER3B = "  " MOVE PRINTER3 TO PRINTER3B.

       62-PAGE-2.
       62-PUT-BUFFER.

      ***  INPUT DATA ABOVE AND PRESS 'ENTER'  ***
           MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM.
           MOVE  20 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO PRNT-MSGLINE2.

       62-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE PRNT-SCREEN2 TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC TO PRNT-SCREEN2.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 62-PAGE-2-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERR-MSGLINE2
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
               GO TO 62-SHOW-FORM.

       62-REPLACE-MPLTINFO.
           IF CAPITAL-ITEM-INDIC = "N"
               MOVE ZEROS TO CAPITAL-ITEM-PRT.

           MOVE "STST" TO MPLTINFO-ARG, BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE DE-PRT-SNGL   TO  MPLT-PRINT-SINGLE-ISS
               MOVE DE-PRT-MULT   TO  MPLT-PRINT-MULT-ISS
               MOVE DE-SNGL-ADV   TO  MPLT-ADV-AFTER-SINGLE
               MOVE DE-WS-SPLIT   TO  MPLT-WS-ITEMS-SPLIT
               MOVE DE-ADV-LE-WS  TO  MPLT-ADV-AFTER-LE-X-WS
               MOVE DE-ADV-GT-WS  TO  MPLT-ADV-AFTER-GT-X-WS
               REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-REWRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "2REWRITE  ERROR IN 62-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES   TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "STST"   TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE "08"       TO  MPLTINFO-STR-PRT
               MOVE "Y"        TO  MPLT-ALWAYS-MULT-STR-CODE
               MOVE "N"        TO  MPLT-MULT-STR-FLAG
               MOVE "Y"        TO  MPLT-WO-OVERRD-ENTRY
               MOVE "N"        TO  MPLT-WO-OVERRD-EXP
               MOVE "N"        TO  MPLT-ENTRY-OVERRD-EXP
               MOVE "N"        TO  MPLT-WS-PW-SW
               MOVE "N"        TO  MPLT-VALID-EMPL-CRAFTWS
               MOVE "N"        TO  MPLT-VALID-EMPL-STORES
               MOVE SPACES     TO  MPLT-WS-NUMBER
               MOVE "N"        TO  MPLT-ALLOW-RETURN-VALUE
               MOVE "N"        TO  MPLT-PRINT-SINGLE-ISS
               MOVE "N"        TO  MPLT-PRINT-MULT-ISS
               MOVE "N"        TO  MPLT-MULTI-INSTEAD-RW
               MOVE 1          TO  MPLT-ADV-AFTER-SINGLE
               MOVE 1          TO  MPLT-WS-ITEMS-SPLIT
               MOVE 1          TO  MPLT-ADV-AFTER-LE-X-WS
               MOVE 1          TO  MPLT-ADV-AFTER-GT-X-WS
               MOVE "N"        TO  MPLT-MP1-OVERRD-CHG-DEPT
               WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-WRITE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "2WRT MPLTINFO ERROR IN 62-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   PERFORM 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
               MOVE "2READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 62-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

       62-PAGE-2-X.
           EXIT.

       63-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "POPT" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-PO-PRT-NO    TO PRINTER1
               MOVE MPLTINFO-PO-PRT-MPE-SPOOLED TO PRINTER1-MPE-SPOOLED
               MOVE MPLTINFO-REQ-PRT-NO   TO PRINTER2
               MOVE MPLTINFO-REQ-PRT-NO-2 TO PRINTER2A
               MOVE MPLTINFO-PO-HP-PRINTER-SW
                                          TO PRINTER1-HP-SW
               MOVE MPLTINFO-01-QUOTE-PRT-NO TO PRINTER3
               MOVE MPLTINFO-02-QUOTE-PRT-NO TO PRINTER3A
               MOVE MPLTINFO-LP-QUOTE-PRT-NO TO PRINTER3B
               MOVE MPLTINFO-INTERN-PRT-1 TO PRINTER4
               MOVE MPLTINFO-INTERN-PRT-2 TO PRINTER5
               MOVE MPLTINFO-RAWMAT-PRT-NO TO PRINTER7
               IF MPLTINFO-SHIP-REL-PRT-NO NOT = SPACES
                   MOVE MPLTINFO-SHIP-REL-PRT-NO TO PRINTER8
               ELSE
                   MOVE MPLTINFO-PO-PRT-NO TO PRINTER8
               END-IF
               IF MPLTINFO-PO-SPECIAL = SPACES OR ZEROES
                   MOVE MPLTINFO-PO-PRT-NO    TO PRINTER9
                   MOVE "999999"              TO PRINTER9-DOLLARS
               ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-PO-SPECIAL       TO PRINTER9
               END-IF
               IF MPLTINFO-PO-SP-AMOUNT = "      "
                   MOVE "999999"              TO PRINTER9-DOLLARS
               ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-PO-SP-AMOUNT     TO PRINTER9-DOLLARS
               END-IF
               IF MPLTINFO-CAP-ITEM-PRT > ZERO
                   MOVE "Y"                   TO CAPITAL-ITEM-INDIC
                   MOVE MPLTINFO-CAP-ITEM-PRT TO CAPITAL-ITEM-PRT
               ELSE
                   MOVE "N"                   TO CAPITAL-ITEM-INDIC
                   MOVE SPACES                TO CAPITAL-ITEM-PRT
               END-IF
               MOVE MPLTINFO-NOASCII-REPORTS  TO NOASCII-REPORTS
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
               MOVE "3READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 63-READ-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "POPT" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE "ST00"                   TO   MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE MPLTINFO-STR-PRT     TO   PRINTER6
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
               MOVE "READ ERR MPLTINFO ST00" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

           MOVE "RQRL" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               IF REQ-RLSE-PRINT-CONTROL = "PURCH" OR
                  REQ-RLSE-PRINT-CONTROL = SPACES
                   MOVE "Y" TO REQ-RLSE-INDIC
                   MOVE "P" TO REQ-RLSE-PRINTER
               ELSE
               IF REQ-RLSE-PRINT-CONTROL = "LOCAL"
                   MOVE "Y" TO REQ-RLSE-INDIC
                   MOVE "L" TO REQ-RLSE-PRINTER
               ELSE
               IF REQ-RLSE-PRINT-CONTROL = "NOPRT"
                   MOVE "N" TO REQ-RLSE-INDIC
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
               MOVE "3GET MPLTINFO ERROR IN 63-READ-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "RQRL" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           START MPLTINFO-O KEY > PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

           MOVE "STST" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE MPLT-PRINT-SINGLE-ISS   TO DE-PRT-SNGL
               MOVE MPLT-PRINT-MULT-ISS     TO DE-PRT-MULT
               IF MPLT-ADV-AFTER-SINGLE NOT NUMERIC
                   MOVE ZEROS                   TO DE-SNGL-ADV
               ELSE
                   MOVE MPLT-ADV-AFTER-SINGLE   TO DE-SNGL-ADV
               END-IF
               IF MPLT-WS-ITEMS-SPLIT   NOT NUMERIC
                   MOVE ZEROS                   TO DE-WS-SPLIT
               ELSE
                   MOVE MPLT-WS-ITEMS-SPLIT     TO DE-WS-SPLIT
               END-IF
               IF MPLT-ADV-AFTER-LE-X-WS  NOT NUMERIC
                   MOVE ZEROS                   TO DE-ADV-LE-WS
               ELSE
                   MOVE MPLT-ADV-AFTER-LE-X-WS  TO DE-ADV-LE-WS
               END-IF
               IF MPLT-ADV-AFTER-GT-X-WS  NOT NUMERIC
                   MOVE ZEROS                   TO DE-ADV-GT-WS
               ELSE
                   MOVE MPLT-ADV-AFTER-GT-X-WS  TO DE-ADV-GT-WS
               END-IF
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
               MOVE "1READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 63-READ-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "STST" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.


       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.
      *********************************************************
       999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.
